1
00:00:03,837 --> 00:00:05,631
Honored visiting delegates,

2
00:00:05,756 --> 00:00:07,799
the Havens will work together!

3
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:10,135
What are
the Head Lotuses of Akasha

4
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,177
and New Ba doing here?

5
00:00:11,178 --> 00:00:12,303
Rumors about the Avatar

6
00:00:12,304 --> 00:00:13,346
reach a fever pitch,

7
00:00:13,347 --> 00:00:15,098
and you cut communications
with us?

8
00:00:15,224 --> 00:00:18,100
We feel it's time
she faced The Trial.

9
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:20,144
But Nisha's only nine years old!

10
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:21,270
She's just a child!

11
00:00:21,271 --> 00:00:23,022
If we find whoever made
my brooch

12
00:00:23,023 --> 00:00:24,274
and your bracelet,

13
00:00:24,733 --> 00:00:26,610
they might lead us
to Mom and Dad!

14
00:00:26,735 --> 00:00:30,696
Are you really going to choose
strangers over me?

15
00:00:34,159 --> 00:00:36,203
What is the meaning of this?

16
00:00:36,828 --> 00:00:39,790
My Queen freed me.

17
00:00:44,628 --> 00:00:46,213
Let's chat.

18
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:50,133
<i>Fire...</i>

19
00:00:50,634 --> 00:00:51,884
<i>Air.</i>

20
00:00:51,885 --> 00:00:53,011
<i>Water.</i>

21
00:00:53,554 --> 00:00:54,555
<i>Earth.</i>

22
00:00:56,098 --> 00:00:58,140
<i>Long ago, the Avatar,</i>

23
00:00:58,141 --> 00:01:00,102
<i>master of all four elements,</i>

24
00:01:00,227 --> 00:01:02,812
<i>brought forth the Cataclysm,</i>

25
00:01:02,813 --> 00:01:04,354
<i>Out of the devastation,</i>

26
00:01:04,355 --> 00:01:07,191
<i>the world built
the Seven Havens.</i>

27
00:01:07,192 --> 00:01:09,277
<i>Now the Avatar has returned,</i>

28
00:01:09,278 --> 00:01:12,531
<i>but for the first time,
there are two.</i>

29
00:01:12,656 --> 00:01:15,075
<i>Most fear they'll destroy
the world again...</i>

30
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,867
<i>But I believe...</i>

31
00:01:16,868 --> 00:01:18,286
<i>they will save it.</i>

32
00:01:28,213 --> 00:01:29,798
Something's wrong.

33
00:01:31,466 --> 00:01:33,093
Let's scramble, Geet!

34
00:01:33,885 --> 00:01:35,596
I hope Nisha's okay.

35
00:01:38,265 --> 00:01:41,058
The Faceless Queen
finally crawled out of her hole

36
00:01:41,059 --> 00:01:42,644
to attack us here,

37
00:01:42,769 --> 00:01:45,188
surrounded by
our strongest benders.

38
00:01:46,607 --> 00:01:49,358
You're bold. Or mad.

39
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:50,652
Guards!

40
00:01:51,820 --> 00:01:52,696
Ah!

41
00:01:55,198 --> 00:01:59,328
Lucky for you, the only thing
bruised is my pride!

42
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:03,831
Who said I was here to fight?

43
00:02:05,584 --> 00:02:07,210
This one sounded the alarm.

44
00:02:07,336 --> 00:02:10,046
And ruined my pudding!

45
00:02:10,047 --> 00:02:12,633
Someone's quite
the trumpet player.

46
00:02:13,050 --> 00:02:15,926
Thanks for heralding
our arrival, bender!

47
00:02:15,927 --> 00:02:18,722
Welcome to Ellora, ambassadors!

48
00:02:18,847 --> 00:02:20,724
Your havens
are gonna wanna hear this.

49
00:02:20,849 --> 00:02:22,726
Now see here, ruffian!

50
00:02:22,851 --> 00:02:26,312
This sort of renegade activity
may pass in Ellora,

51
00:02:26,313 --> 00:02:28,190
but you're dealing
with the authority

52
00:02:28,315 --> 00:02:30,233
of New Ba Sing Se--

53
00:02:30,901 --> 00:02:33,945
Watch the outfit,
it's an antique!

54
00:02:34,071 --> 00:02:35,697
Mm.

55
00:02:42,829 --> 00:02:43,996
The Faceless?

56
00:02:43,997 --> 00:02:46,416
Something's gone really wrong
with the summit.

57
00:02:49,753 --> 00:02:52,047
Stay here, girl.
I'll whistle if I need you.

58
00:02:55,342 --> 00:02:58,220
Your Faceless
bandits have already taken

59
00:02:58,345 --> 00:02:59,429
so much from us.

60
00:03:00,138 --> 00:03:03,016
What more do you want?
Our blood?

61
00:03:03,141 --> 00:03:06,186
You know who originally owned
my snack shop?

62
00:03:07,020 --> 00:03:08,730
My father.

63
00:03:08,855 --> 00:03:10,315
Awful jokes,

64
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,983
but his kachori recipe

65
00:03:12,109 --> 00:03:16,113
was the best
this side of the Harshlands.

66
00:03:17,656 --> 00:03:21,159
The Brigade discovered
he was a bender.

67
00:03:22,494 --> 00:03:25,205
All he wanted to do
was feed people.

68
00:03:25,330 --> 00:03:28,208
Instead he was conscripted,

69
00:03:28,333 --> 00:03:31,128
forced to serve his haven.

70
00:03:32,212 --> 00:03:34,631
He died in service.

71
00:03:35,674 --> 00:03:37,926
Yeah. That's terrible.

72
00:03:42,055 --> 00:03:43,806
I fled Ellora soon after.

73
00:03:43,807 --> 00:03:45,850
I couldn't bear
living in a place

74
00:03:45,851 --> 00:03:48,437
that prided itself on his loss.

75
00:03:48,562 --> 00:03:50,813
"For the survival of Ellora!"

76
00:03:50,814 --> 00:03:52,064
What a crock of camodillo!

77
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:54,984
Your father has more honor
than you ever will!

78
00:03:54,985 --> 00:03:56,110
His sacrifice meant--

79
00:03:56,111 --> 00:03:57,528
Meant what?

80
00:03:57,529 --> 00:04:00,239
Another generation of benders
would be forced

81
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,325
into a life they don't want?

82
00:04:03,452 --> 00:04:07,122
Benders, being trapped
behind these walls

83
00:04:07,247 --> 00:04:08,749
isn't truly living.

84
00:04:09,166 --> 00:04:11,710
A few of you
have already realized that.

85
00:04:11,835 --> 00:04:15,546
Let me introduce you
to our new recruits.

86
00:04:15,547 --> 00:04:17,715
The missing benders?

87
00:04:22,137 --> 00:04:24,722
Uki... how could you?

88
00:04:24,723 --> 00:04:26,183
You're following a madwoman!

89
00:04:26,308 --> 00:04:28,476
She's nothing like
what you've been told.

90
00:04:28,477 --> 00:04:30,437
Agam can save us all.

91
00:04:31,938 --> 00:04:34,983
We're with the Faceless because
we want a different life,

92
00:04:35,108 --> 00:04:38,320
free from danger,
where we choose our own destiny.

93
00:04:38,445 --> 00:04:41,113
- Really?
- You can do that?

94
00:04:41,114 --> 00:04:43,533
What sort of destiny is that?

95
00:04:44,618 --> 00:04:47,996
We're going to Republic Forest.

96
00:04:58,256 --> 00:04:59,882
Mudpies!

97
00:04:59,883 --> 00:05:01,802
What's going on up there?

98
00:05:02,302 --> 00:05:04,429
Don't worry! This is just a...

99
00:05:04,554 --> 00:05:06,723
normal Brigade drill.

100
00:05:07,641 --> 00:05:10,227
Stay calm! This is all routine!

101
00:05:12,312 --> 00:05:14,564
Go about your lives!

102
00:05:15,524 --> 00:05:17,526
Who's that?

103
00:05:17,651 --> 00:05:20,028
The Republic Forest
cut themselves off

104
00:05:20,153 --> 00:05:22,071
from the rest of us ages ago!

105
00:05:22,072 --> 00:05:25,367
Yeah, I don't think you're gonna
get a very warm welcome.

106
00:05:25,492 --> 00:05:26,742
If they're even alive.

107
00:05:26,743 --> 00:05:29,162
No one's inviting
the two of you.

108
00:05:31,790 --> 00:05:34,417
We believe the Republic Forest

109
00:05:34,543 --> 00:05:38,087
is free from the deadly storms
that plague us all.

110
00:05:38,088 --> 00:05:42,174
Where benders and non-benders
can live without fear,

111
00:05:42,175 --> 00:05:43,425
without oppression.

112
00:05:43,426 --> 00:05:45,846
Cute! You believe
in fairy tales.

113
00:05:48,098 --> 00:05:49,849
Thanks to your "donation"

114
00:05:49,850 --> 00:05:52,268
of gear, food, and herd animals,

115
00:05:52,269 --> 00:05:54,812
the Faceless are ready
to cross the Harshlands

116
00:05:54,813 --> 00:05:56,105
to the Lost Haven.

117
00:05:56,106 --> 00:05:58,149
And here is my invitation.

118
00:05:58,650 --> 00:06:01,610
If any benders have had enough

119
00:06:01,611 --> 00:06:05,532
of a crumbling system
that no longer protects them,

120
00:06:05,949 --> 00:06:07,242
you're welcome to join us.

121
00:06:07,742 --> 00:06:10,828
She's trying
to take our benders?

122
00:06:10,829 --> 00:06:12,622
To everyone else,

123
00:06:12,747 --> 00:06:14,749
heed this warning now.

124
00:06:15,208 --> 00:06:18,252
Stay out of our way.

125
00:06:18,253 --> 00:06:21,380
Months of raids that have
terrified our citizens,

126
00:06:21,381 --> 00:06:23,507
crippled our haven,
and for what,

127
00:06:23,508 --> 00:06:25,259
a doomed mission?

128
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:29,639
Our remaining benders
are loyal to Ellora.

129
00:06:30,515 --> 00:06:31,391
Are you?

130
00:06:32,142 --> 00:06:34,977
- Never questioned it before.
- Never thought about it before.

131
00:06:34,978 --> 00:06:37,980
I didn't even
know that was an option.

132
00:06:37,981 --> 00:06:40,400
Come on,
kick her bandit butt!

133
00:06:44,362 --> 00:06:46,155
Any benders
that join the Faceless

134
00:06:46,156 --> 00:06:50,452
will be considered traitors
to Ellora and arrested!

135
00:06:50,577 --> 00:06:52,703
It's like I always said!

136
00:06:52,704 --> 00:06:54,663
We're just tools to the Council.

137
00:06:54,664 --> 00:06:56,081
- I'm done!
- He's right!

138
00:06:56,082 --> 00:06:57,375
I'm done with this.

139
00:06:57,500 --> 00:07:00,086
If you leave,
you'll doom your home!

140
00:07:00,712 --> 00:07:02,463
- He's right.
- I'm with the Faceless!

141
00:07:02,464 --> 00:07:03,840
No more benders' blood!

142
00:07:03,965 --> 00:07:05,424
What's the point of it all?

143
00:07:05,425 --> 00:07:07,469
Yeah, I'm out of here!

144
00:07:09,095 --> 00:07:11,347
Oh, no, no.

145
00:07:22,275 --> 00:07:24,360
Guards, arrest them!

146
00:07:24,361 --> 00:07:27,321
Arrest who? The Faceless?

147
00:07:27,322 --> 00:07:28,823
The traitors?

148
00:07:28,949 --> 00:07:30,450
Everyone!

149
00:07:32,994 --> 00:07:34,453
Don't try to stop us.

150
00:07:34,454 --> 00:07:36,373
You'll just embarrass yourself.

151
00:07:43,004 --> 00:07:45,130
You're not going anywhere!

152
00:07:49,177 --> 00:07:51,680
- Who is that?
- What's going on?

153
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:55,225
Karthik's niece can bend?

154
00:07:55,850 --> 00:07:58,769
I thought she was
just his assistant!

155
00:07:58,770 --> 00:08:00,939
I thought she was a small adult.

156
00:08:01,064 --> 00:08:02,983
She's very intimidating.

157
00:08:03,108 --> 00:08:06,276
This is definitely not good.

158
00:08:06,277 --> 00:08:08,154
O-ho!

159
00:08:08,655 --> 00:08:10,615
Hello again, little bender!

160
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:12,408
Nisha, was it?

161
00:08:12,409 --> 00:08:15,327
The bravest amongst you
has stepped forward,

162
00:08:15,328 --> 00:08:16,662
and she's a toddler!

163
00:08:16,663 --> 00:08:18,415
Watch it, auntie.

164
00:08:23,003 --> 00:08:25,130
Decent strength, for a child.

165
00:08:25,255 --> 00:08:27,006
But your form is sloppy.

166
00:08:31,094 --> 00:08:32,220
Ha!

167
00:08:34,347 --> 00:08:37,682
Creative, but your expression
gave the attack away.

168
00:08:37,683 --> 00:08:40,102
You must be calm as a stone.

169
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:42,355
Stop giving me notes!

170
00:08:46,609 --> 00:08:47,819
What's going on?

171
00:08:47,944 --> 00:08:49,362
Agam's fighting Nisha?

172
00:08:49,779 --> 00:08:52,240
How do we help Nisha
without being seen?

173
00:08:54,784 --> 00:08:57,746
You're a better cook
than a bandit.

174
00:09:02,959 --> 00:09:06,921
Oh, kiddo. I'm good
at a lot of things!

175
00:09:09,299 --> 00:09:12,468
Y-You... You're a bender?

176
00:09:12,469 --> 00:09:13,886
What can I say?

177
00:09:13,887 --> 00:09:16,639
Like father, like daughter.

178
00:09:21,644 --> 00:09:23,312
You're fast on your feet!

179
00:09:23,313 --> 00:09:26,608
Too bad you only know
the Elloran styles.

180
00:09:35,658 --> 00:09:37,660
This isn't your fight, child.

181
00:09:37,786 --> 00:09:38,911
Yes, it is!

182
00:09:38,912 --> 00:09:41,122
Ellora's mine
to protect because...

183
00:09:51,758 --> 00:09:53,718
I'm the Avatar!

184
00:09:54,636 --> 00:09:56,345
The Avatar!

185
00:09:56,346 --> 00:09:57,514
Nisha!

186
00:09:57,972 --> 00:09:59,265
No!

187
00:10:05,772 --> 00:10:07,816
No, it can't be...

188
00:10:12,237 --> 00:10:13,445
That's the Destroyer!

189
00:10:13,446 --> 00:10:15,572
Oh, Nisha.

190
00:10:15,573 --> 00:10:16,699
What have you done?

191
00:10:16,825 --> 00:10:20,328
Um... greetings, everyone.

192
00:10:22,038 --> 00:10:23,623
Ahh!

193
00:10:23,748 --> 00:10:26,083
The Avatar has returned!

194
00:10:26,084 --> 00:10:28,252
Yes, but don't worry!
I'm here to--

195
00:10:28,253 --> 00:10:29,795
Wait. The Avatar?

196
00:10:29,796 --> 00:10:31,922
Someone do something!

197
00:10:35,426 --> 00:10:37,387
I thought the cycle was broken.

198
00:10:37,512 --> 00:10:39,472
How is this possible?

199
00:10:40,807 --> 00:10:42,058
Time to go.

200
00:10:51,985 --> 00:10:53,235
Back to the hideout!

201
00:10:53,236 --> 00:10:55,029
The others need
to hear the news.

202
00:10:55,572 --> 00:10:58,408
The Avatar?
Didn't see that coming.

203
00:10:58,533 --> 00:11:02,494
That little one is in
for the fight of her life.

204
00:11:02,495 --> 00:11:03,621
Nisha...

205
00:11:04,164 --> 00:11:06,915
What are you waiting for?

206
00:11:06,916 --> 00:11:08,751
Arrest the Avatar!

207
00:11:09,836 --> 00:11:12,046
Wait! I'm not gonna hurt anyone!

208
00:11:19,596 --> 00:11:22,681
The Avatar's causing
the Second Cataclysm!

209
00:11:22,682 --> 00:11:24,016
I'm not doing this!

210
00:11:24,017 --> 00:11:25,684
I'm not a destroyer!

211
00:12:03,640 --> 00:12:05,224
Karthik!

212
00:12:05,225 --> 00:12:06,643
Where have you been?

213
00:12:06,768 --> 00:12:08,310
Kayoko, I can explain.

214
00:12:08,311 --> 00:12:09,978
Commander,
you have to tell them.

215
00:12:09,979 --> 00:12:13,149
I'm not bad! I just...
I just wanted to help!

216
00:12:13,816 --> 00:12:16,319
Of course!

217
00:12:16,986 --> 00:12:19,155
She's your ward.

218
00:12:20,073 --> 00:12:23,784
You hid her true nature
from me! I...

219
00:12:23,785 --> 00:12:25,578
I-I trusted you!

220
00:12:26,454 --> 00:12:27,789
We-we all did!

221
00:12:28,289 --> 00:12:30,874
I was going to tell you,
I swear.

222
00:12:30,875 --> 00:12:32,918
Kayoko, everything
we've been taught

223
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:35,879
about the Avatar is half-truths.
I've learned--

224
00:12:39,384 --> 00:12:42,178
Avatar! Send back your minion!

225
00:12:42,595 --> 00:12:44,513
You think I control this thing?

226
00:12:44,514 --> 00:12:47,600
Nisha, remember
your energybending from before.

227
00:12:47,725 --> 00:12:49,477
I know you can banish it!

228
00:12:49,602 --> 00:12:52,105
Uh, I'll try, Commander.

229
00:13:18,631 --> 00:13:21,050
Good! Hold it steady!

230
00:13:42,405 --> 00:13:43,573
Nisha!

231
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:44,991
Who cares if people see me?

232
00:13:45,116 --> 00:13:47,327
I need to help my sister.

233
00:14:00,381 --> 00:14:02,424
You like fear?

234
00:14:02,425 --> 00:14:05,345
Look at me! I'm super scared!

235
00:14:12,018 --> 00:14:14,270
Mudpies! That actually worked!

236
00:14:18,524 --> 00:14:20,693
We might be in trouble, Geet!

237
00:14:22,445 --> 00:14:24,780
Huh?

238
00:14:30,036 --> 00:14:32,371
- Help me.
- You did this to us!

239
00:14:32,372 --> 00:14:33,915
I didn't, I promise!

240
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:35,832
You have to believe me!

241
00:14:35,833 --> 00:14:39,336
You've come back to destroy
the world once and for all.

242
00:14:39,337 --> 00:14:42,799
Stop her by any means necessary.

243
00:14:55,853 --> 00:14:57,688
We are the White Lotus!

244
00:14:57,814 --> 00:14:59,857
Protector of the Avatar.

245
00:14:59,982 --> 00:15:03,486
So, a conspiracy was growing
right under my nose.

246
00:15:03,611 --> 00:15:04,695
Quickly! Move!

247
00:15:04,821 --> 00:15:07,240
- Get them!
- Traitors!

248
00:15:10,910 --> 00:15:12,828
Commander, I'm sorry.

249
00:15:12,829 --> 00:15:16,040
I... I just wanted
to make you proud.

250
00:15:16,457 --> 00:15:18,375
You always have, Nisha.

251
00:15:18,376 --> 00:15:22,171
Who's foolish enough to face
the Human Hurricane first?

252
00:16:00,001 --> 00:16:02,086
Ahh!

253
00:16:22,648 --> 00:16:24,233
Ahh!

254
00:16:27,445 --> 00:16:30,322
Run, Nisha!

255
00:16:35,620 --> 00:16:38,164
So, this is the real Karthik.

256
00:16:38,831 --> 00:16:41,876
We have no space
for traitors in Ellora!

257
00:16:42,001 --> 00:16:43,169
End them!

258
00:16:55,598 --> 00:16:58,433
Commander Karthik,
you are under arrest!

259
00:16:58,434 --> 00:17:00,895
Jae!
What are you doing?

260
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:13,199
Where did the Avatar go, traitor?

261
00:17:13,324 --> 00:17:14,784
No idea,

262
00:17:15,201 --> 00:17:17,369
but you won't find her.

263
00:17:23,626 --> 00:17:26,546
I thought spirit energy
was good for Avatars!

264
00:17:26,671 --> 00:17:29,465
But you just bring pain
and fear!

265
00:17:38,808 --> 00:17:41,059
What do you want from me?

266
00:17:44,188 --> 00:17:45,564
Huh?

267
00:17:53,406 --> 00:17:55,449
Chancellor,
I beg your forgiveness.

268
00:17:55,575 --> 00:17:58,868
The Commander used my allegiance
to the Brigade against me,

269
00:17:58,869 --> 00:18:00,830
seducing me
into the White Lotus.

270
00:18:00,955 --> 00:18:02,455
I was tempted,

271
00:18:02,456 --> 00:18:06,127
but now I see how damaging
their deceit has been.

272
00:18:06,961 --> 00:18:09,547
My loyalty is to Ellora...

273
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:10,965
always.

274
00:18:11,424 --> 00:18:13,843
Jae, you're betraying the Order!

275
00:18:14,343 --> 00:18:16,512
No, you betrayed Ellora.

276
00:18:16,637 --> 00:18:17,930
I see that now.

277
00:18:21,642 --> 00:18:23,269
I'm proud of you, Jae.

278
00:18:30,151 --> 00:18:32,278
Hmm. I forgive you, Jae.

279
00:18:32,737 --> 00:18:36,616
I know all too well
how convincing Karthik can be.

280
00:18:37,450 --> 00:18:40,035
I will find the Avatar,

281
00:18:40,036 --> 00:18:43,623
even if I have to tear down
every brick in Ellora.

282
00:18:44,081 --> 00:18:46,082
We will track down her friends,

283
00:18:46,083 --> 00:18:48,586
her family, her foolish allies!

284
00:18:49,629 --> 00:18:52,506
Someone will talk.

285
00:18:55,635 --> 00:18:58,262
Datu, tear apart
the Brigade Compound.

286
00:18:58,721 --> 00:19:02,099
Commander Jae will guide you
to the other dissenters.

287
00:19:04,310 --> 00:19:06,729
What have you done?

288
00:19:08,939 --> 00:19:11,359
For the survival of Ellora.

289
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,076
Okay...

290
00:19:20,868 --> 00:19:22,912
This is new.

291
00:19:25,998 --> 00:19:28,084
Hello!

292
00:19:30,169 --> 00:19:32,713
Oh! Uh... thank you?

293
00:19:32,838 --> 00:19:34,756
That's very helpful.

294
00:19:41,555 --> 00:19:44,642
Ooh... pretty.

295
00:20:14,672 --> 00:20:16,924
See that they get the best care.

296
00:20:17,341 --> 00:20:18,718
What gives, Kayoko?

297
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:22,096
You've been hiding the scourge
of humanity within your haven!

298
00:20:22,221 --> 00:20:23,639
Me? We... I...

299
00:20:24,056 --> 00:20:26,099
I know nothing about this girl!

300
00:20:26,100 --> 00:20:29,895
This might explain why Ellora's
been plagued with disasters.

301
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:33,648
Chancellor, I am deeply sorry

302
00:20:33,649 --> 00:20:36,444
for the devastation
that has been brought on Ellora.

303
00:20:36,569 --> 00:20:38,237
We've discussed
your deception and we--

304
00:20:38,362 --> 00:20:39,779
We're withdrawing our aid!

305
00:20:39,780 --> 00:20:41,906
But Ellora needs you!

306
00:20:41,907 --> 00:20:43,284
We had an agreement!

307
00:20:43,743 --> 00:20:45,201
Tell that to Kuzon!

308
00:20:45,202 --> 00:20:47,955
Oh, wait, you can't.
He's afflicted!

309
00:20:50,416 --> 00:20:52,167
I'm getting out
of this cursed haven

310
00:20:52,168 --> 00:20:53,544
as fast as I can.

311
00:20:54,044 --> 00:20:55,796
This was a terrible summit!

312
00:20:57,047 --> 00:20:59,091
The food was surprisingly good.

313
00:21:00,551 --> 00:21:02,761
I am sorry, Kayoko.

314
00:21:02,762 --> 00:21:04,680
We must think of our own people.

315
00:21:05,431 --> 00:21:08,767
When you get control
of your haven, contact me.

316
00:21:08,768 --> 00:21:11,812
Feather Mountain makes space
for forgiveness.

317
00:21:18,027 --> 00:21:19,153
Chancellor...

318
00:21:19,737 --> 00:21:21,530
What do we do now?

319
00:21:23,949 --> 00:21:26,284
What do Ellorans do?

320
00:21:26,285 --> 00:21:29,330
We survive, no matter the cost.

321
00:21:29,830 --> 00:21:32,332
Establish a curfew,
lock the haven down,

322
00:21:32,333 --> 00:21:35,294
arrest any bender
who refuses to serve...

323
00:21:35,753 --> 00:21:38,714
and find the Avatar.

324
00:21:42,384 --> 00:21:44,594
Close the gates
and lock down the city!

325
00:21:44,595 --> 00:21:46,721
The Avatar must be detained!

326
00:21:46,722 --> 00:21:48,724
Orders from the Chancellor!

